     58,
     73,
     69,
     84
    ]
   }
  },
  "clock": null,
  "touch": false
 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "A rising blue sparkline ending on a dot at 84; eight blue columns W1..W8 rising to W8; a ring of eight slices from solid to pale blue with 490 visits in the centre. With variables {visits: [90, 75, 80, 50, 40, 45, 30, 20]} all three change: the line and the bars fall, the first slices grow and the total reads 430. At 252 and 540 dp wide the line and bars follow the width and the ring stays centred at 120 dp.",
